+<!doctype html>
+<!-- SPDX-License-Identifier: CC-BY-NC-ND-4.0; Copyright 2026 Ingolf Lohmann. Executable welcome.js is separately licensed. -->
+<html lang="de" dir="ltr"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
+<meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer"><meta name="description" content="QIK-VRT: Ingolf Lohmanns Arbeit verstehen, Quellen prüfen, Software untersuchen. 14 Sprachen, Prosa und WhatsApp-Texte.">
+<meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="default-src 'none'; script-src 'self'; connect-src 'self'; style-src 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'">
+<title>QIK-VRT · Vom Unterschied zur verantwortlichen Wirkung</title>
+<style>
+:root{color-scheme:light dark;--bg:#f5f3ed;--fg:#182329;--muted:#46545b;--card:#fffef9;--line:#c6cec9;--accent:#125c51;--mark:#fff0ab}
+*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--fg);font:18px/1.8 system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif}a{color:var(--accent);text-underline-offset:.2em;overflow-wrap:anywhere}button,input,select,textarea{font:inherit;color:inherit;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:.45rem;background:var(--card);max-width:100%}button,select{padding:.55rem .8rem;cursor:pointer}input{padding:.55rem;width:100%}button:focus-visible,input:focus-visible,select:focus-visible,a:focus-visible,summary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:4px}header,main,footer{max-width:1120px;margin:auto;padding:1.2rem clamp(1rem,4vw,3rem)}header{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.brand{letter-spacing:.14em;font-size:.9rem;font-weight:750}.byline{font-size:.95rem;color:var(--muted)}h1{font-size:clamp(1.9rem,4vw,3.5rem);line-height:1.18;max-width:24ch;margin:1rem 0 2rem;font-weight:720}.layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 240px;gap:3rem}article p{margin:0 0 1.45rem;hyphens:auto;scroll-margin-top:1rem}aside{font-size:.86rem;color:var(--muted)}aside nav{display:grid;gap:.7rem}.toolbar{display:flex;gap:.7rem;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:end;padding:1rem 0}.field{flex:1 1 14rem}label{display:block;font-size:.85rem}.language{display:flex;gap:1rem;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}.small,#status,#matches{font-size:.86rem;color:var(--muted)}#status{min-height:1.8em}#sources p{margin:.6rem 0;font-size:.85rem}details{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:1rem 0}summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:650}textarea{width:100%;min-height:14rem;padding:.8rem}mark{background:var(--mark);color:#182329}.skip{position:absolute;inset-inline-start:1rem;top:-100px;background:var(--card);padding:.5rem}.skip:focus{top:0}[hidden]{display:none!important}footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);font-size:.85rem}#fallback{padding:1rem;background:var(--card)}html[dir=rtl] article{line-height:2}html[lang=ja] article,html[lang=zh-CN] article{line-height:2;hyphens:none}
+@media(max-width:850px){.layout{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:1rem}aside{order:-1}aside nav{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}aside details:not([open]){margin:0}.toolbar button{flex:1 1 12rem}}
+@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root{--bg:#111d21;--fg:#e5eeea;--muted:#b4c5be;--card:#19282c;--line:#41564e;--accent:#93dccc;--mark:#e9cb6e}}
+@media print{body{background:white;color:black;font-size:12pt}.toolbar,.language,aside,#status,#matches,#sources-details,.skip{display:none}.layout{display:block}a{color:inherit}header,main,footer{padding:0}h1{max-width:none}article p{orphans:3;widows:3}}
+</style><script defer src="welcome.js"></script></head>
+<body data-source-sha256="244b158af4aa9395f9820f3e1410056406eb04f5230e3f55004d9cf63437679b"><a class="skip" href="#article">Zum Text / Skip to article</a>
+<header><div class="language"><div><div class="brand">QIK-VRT</div><div class="byline">Ingolf Lohmann · 2026-09-19</div></div><label>Language · Sprache <select id="language"><option value="de" lang="de" dir="auto">Deutsch</option><option value="en" lang="en" dir="auto">English</option><option value="fr" lang="fr" dir="auto">Français</option><option value="es" lang="es" dir="auto">Español</option><option value="pt-BR" lang="pt-BR" dir="auto">Português (Brasil)</option><option value="it" lang="it" dir="auto">Italiano</option><option value="tr" lang="tr" dir="auto">Türkçe</option><option value="ru" lang="ru" dir="auto">Русский</option><option value="ar" lang="ar" dir="auto">العربية</option><option value="hi" lang="hi" dir="auto">हिन्दी</option><option value="id" lang="id" dir="auto">Bahasa Indonesia</option><option value="ja" lang="ja" dir="auto">日本語</option><option value="ko" lang="ko" dir="auto">한국어</option><option value="zh-CN" lang="zh-CN" dir="auto">简体中文</option></select></label></div></header>
+<main><h1 id="title">Vom Unterschied zur verantwortlichen Wirkung</h1>
+<div id="fallback"><p>Eine Nachricht kann angekommen sein, ohne verstanden worden zu sein. QIK-VRT verbindet Herkunft, Prüfung, Verantwortung, Ausführung und beobachtetes Ergebnis, ohne sie gleichzusetzen.</p><p>Vollständiger Prosa-Artikel in 14 Sprachen / Complete prose in 14 languages:</p><nav aria-label="Markdown languages"><a href="WELCOME.md#de" lang="de" dir="auto">Deutsch</a> · <a href="WELCOME.md#en" lang="en" dir="auto">English</a> · <a href="WELCOME.md#fr" lang="fr" dir="auto">Français</a> · <a href="WELCOME.md#es" lang="es" dir="auto">Español</a> · <a href="WELCOME.md#pt-BR" lang="pt-BR" dir="auto">Português (Brasil)</a> · <a href="WELCOME.md#it" lang="it" dir="auto">Italiano</a> · <a href="WELCOME.md#tr" lang="tr" dir="auto">Türkçe</a> · <a href="WELCOME.md#ru" lang="ru" dir="auto">Русский</a> · <a href="WELCOME.md#ar" lang="ar" dir="auto">العربية</a> · <a href="WELCOME.md#hi" lang="hi" dir="auto">हिन्दी</a> · <a href="WELCOME.md#id" lang="id" dir="auto">Bahasa Indonesia</a> · <a href="WELCOME.md#ja" lang="ja" dir="auto">日本語</a> · <a href="WELCOME.md#ko" lang="ko" dir="auto">한국어</a> · <a href="WELCOME.md#zh-CN" lang="zh-CN" dir="auto">简体中文</a></nav><p class="small">Ohne JavaScript oder bei fehlgeschlagener Quellenprüfung bleibt die vollständige Markdown-Fassung zugänglich. / Without JavaScript, or if source verification fails, the full Markdown edition remains available.</p></div>
+<div id="controls" hidden><div class="toolbar"><div class="field"><label id="search-label" for="search">Im Artikel suchen</label><input id="search" type="search" autocomplete="off" maxlength="120"></div><div class="field"><label id="part-label" for="part">Teil</label><select id="part"></select></div></div><div class="toolbar"><button id="copy" type="button">Für WhatsApp kopieren</button><button id="download" type="button">Text herunterladen</button><a id="full-source" href="WELCOME.md">Markdown</a></div></div>
+<p id="status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><p id="matches" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
+<div id="manual" hidden><label id="manual-label" for="manual-text">Copy manually</label><textarea id="manual-text" readonly></textarea></div>
+<div class="layout"><article id="article" aria-labelledby="title"></article><aside><details><summary id="path-label">Lesepfad</summary><nav id="path"></nav></details><p id="note">Stand 19.09.2026. Quellenbindungen, keine neue Gesamtprüfung.</p><a href="WELCOME_EVIDENCE.json">Evidence · JSON</a></aside></div>
+<details id="sources-details"><summary id="source-label">Quellen und URLs</summary><div id="sources"></div></details></main>
+<footer>© 2026 Ingolf Lohmann · Text: CC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · Code: PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0 · <a href="https://github.com/Goldkelch/qik-vrt/blob/a86054139b49c13c5cd344753b248b46b5daf66f/LICENSE" rel="noreferrer">License map</a></footer></body></html>
